{# @var recipient \App\Entity\User #}
<p>Hi {{ recipient.givenName ?: recipient.email }},</p>

<p>Your Madori data export is ready. It contains your profile, preferences, and
the content you authored — tasks, boards, pages, comments,
tags, API tokens, and the files you uploaded — as a zip archive.</p>

<p>
    <a href="{{ downloadUrl }}">Download your export</a>
</p>

<p>
    This link expires on {{ expiresAt|date('F j, Y') }} — after that the
    archive is deleted and you'll need to request a new export.
</p>

<p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px;">
    You'll need to be signed in to Madori as yourself to download the file — the
    link only works for your account, not for anyone who happens to receive it.
</p>

<p>&mdash; Madori</p>
